#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:9
msgid "Obtain the exact source and pinned dependencies"
msgstr "取得精确源码与锁定依赖"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:11
msgid ""
"Use this guide before executing a repository tutorial. You will obtain an "
"exact Nexus commit and the dependencies selected by your task. Initial "
"retrieval needs Git, Python 3.11+ and network access; it does not build or "
"flash firmware."
msgstr ""
"执行仓库教程前使用本指南，取得准确的 Nexus 提交和当前任务选中的依赖。首次获取需要 Git、Python 3.11+ "
"及网络访问；本流程不构建或刷写固件。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:15
msgid "Select the documented source commit"
msgstr "选择文档对应的源码提交"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:17
msgid ""
"Read the full commit from the documentation source link, source banner or "
"`source.commit` in `documentation-build.json`. A dirty documentation preview"
" is not an immutable source delivery. Record an approved clean commit before"
" using these commands; branch names and version strings do not identify "
"exact bytes."
msgstr ""
"从文档源码链接、来源横幅或 `documentation-build.json` 的 `source.commit` "
"读取完整提交。带工作区修改的文档预览不属于不可变源码交付。执行这些命令前先记录已确认的干净提交；分支名和版本字符串不能标识准确字节。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:22
msgid ""
"Historical documentation packages retain their original manifests and "
"fields. Use their matching fixed instructions when recovering them. Current "
"builds write `documentation-build.json`; a documentation archive manifest is"
" not required to obtain current source. Historical reports do not establish "
"current qualification."
msgstr ""
"历史文档包保留原始 manifest 和字段，恢复时使用与其匹配的固定说明。当前构建写入 `documentation-"
"build.json`；获取当前源码不需要文档归档 manifest。历史报告不建立当前资格。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:27
msgid "Retrieve only that source revision"
msgstr "只取得所选源码版本"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:29
msgid ""
"Run from a working parent directory. Replace the placeholder with the "
"selected 40-character commit; choose a new checkout directory:"
msgstr "在工作父目录执行。将占位符替换为选中的 40 字符提交，并选择新的检出目录："

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:45
msgid ""
"Check each exit status and stop on failure. HEAD must match the selected "
"commit and the checkout must be clean. Preparation checks the catalogue, "
"parent gitlinks and only the selected recursive dependency closure. "
"Unselected inventory may remain uninitialized; `git submodule status "
"--recursive` therefore does not require every repository dependency to be "
"populated. Firmware configuration never downloads dependencies or "
"substitutes a newer revision."
msgstr ""
"核对每条命令的退出状态，失败时停止。HEAD 必须与所选提交相同，检出内容必须干净。准备工具核对目录、父级 "
"gitlink，以及仅被选中的递归依赖闭包。未选库存可以不初始化，因此 `git submodule status --recursive` "
"不要求仓库全部依赖均已取得。固件配置不会下载依赖或替换为较新版本。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:52
msgid ""
"For an MCU task, prepare the exact maintained preset instead of unrelated "
"SDKs:"
msgstr "MCU 任务只准备准确的维护 preset 所选依赖："

#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:59
msgid ""
"A verified Source SDK is an independent consumption path. Its full prefix "
"contains source, selected dependencies, licenses and CMake package metadata;"
" it does not need the repository's historical artifact branches. Follow the "
"[Source SDK tutorial](../tutorials/source-sdk.md) for export and "
"consumption."
msgstr ""
"已核验的 Source SDK 是独立消费路径。完整 prefix 包含源码、所选依赖、许可证和 CMake "
"包元数据，不需要仓库的历史产物分支。导出与使用见 [Source SDK 教程](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)。"

