#: ../../../docs/guides/source-checkout.md:74
msgid ""
"Tutorials run from the repository root. Keep independent consumers outside "
"that checkout and retain actual reports before removing only your own "
"output. A clean source identity does not replace tests, independent SDK "
"checks or physical HIL."
msgstr ""
"教程从仓库根运行。独立消费者放在检出目录之外，删除自己生成的输出前保留真实报告。干净源码身份不能代替测试、独立 SDK 核验或物理 HIL。"
